 iii) Ld. ADM failed to appreciate that the the F  Analyst's report is not admissible as the Delhi F  Laboratory which issued the analysis report is not   competent lab to analyze the samples of food as  Section 43 FSS Act being not NABL Accredited or  notified in Official Gazette as per Section 3(1)(p) FSS Act.
